519276735070524_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=484xlRmbmvUQ7kNvwHMbNOI&_nc_oc=AdrAiKcOUddeWv_GJdlTh9Cn71iTfyOpvN97ZCN5-bnVK2aiJtrTMncqFNltuvUR0lA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSUrF_cJK7jG3MlLn0nKaJMJ-uMpwew3TN5iWzh1syX7w&oe=6AFC89A5"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "726424543223322", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618274_726424546556655_6342118991091342726_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zgMdIcYdUdUQ7kNvwHrQRf-&_nc_oc=Adq_cz6YOcB49VpNIH5K3_eXg52PoeHJwsnx83fIm0c-VUHaxuY2OnFJIPyYCC0mC_s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSXFfi2cUuwQXY8kSLjWX9Sy6YBsJAozqN2Zd3f84HyeA&oe=6AFC6C6F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Parking Simulator: The Ultimate Test", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Welcome to Parking Simulator: The Ultimate Test, the ultimate driving challenge that puts your parking skills to the test! Whether you're a seasoned driver or a beginner looking to hone your abilities, this immersive simulator offers a realistic experience that will engage and entertain you. With a variety of vehicles, including cars, buses, and trucks, you'll navigate through increasingly complex parking scenarios, mastering the art of parking in diverse environments.\n\nRealistic Driving Mechanics\nAt the heart of Parking Simulator: The Ultimate Test is its commitment to realistic driving mechanics. Players will experience authentic vehicle handling that mimics real-life driving dynamics. Each vehicle type behaves differently, requiring you to adapt your approach based on its size, weight, and turning radius. The game features intuitive controls that make it easy to accelerate, brake, and steer, allowing you to focus on perfecting your parking skills without frustration.\n\nRealistic Environments\nImmerse yourself in beautifully rendered environments that create a lifelike driving experience. Each location is crafted with attention to detail, featuring realistic lighting, weather conditions, and sound effects. From bustling city streets to serene suburban neighborhoods, the variety of settings keeps the gameplay fresh and engaging. You\u2019ll feel as if you are truly behind the wheel, navigating through dynamic environments that react to your actions.", "short_description": "Parking Simulator: The Ultimate Test is an immersive driving experience that challenges your parking skills with cars, buses, and trucks. Navigate through a variety of complex scenarios, from busy city streets to tight parking lots, as you complete missions designed to test your precision and timing. This simulator offers realistic controls and stunning graphics. Master your parking abilities and tackle increasingly difficult levels to become the ultimate parking pro!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/fionxygames/meta-quest-privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Fionxy Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/fionxygames/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25011621581783726"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.577